<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 72.0951 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 72.0951 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 72.0951 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday from 71.7642 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				  Nov 27		    Nov 26</p>
<p>    tenge per dollar	72.0951		   71.7642</p>
<p>    volume ( $ million)	 11.470		    15.135</p>
<p>				  Nov 27		    Nov 25</p>
<p>    tenge per mark	  47.5009		   47.6222</p>
<p>    volume ( DM million)	 0.055		     0.045</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509 410</p>
</text>
